  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released The Eligibility Result for the recruitment of <strong data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"274\">Forensic Science Laboratory</strong> on its official website.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">This&nbsp;<span class=\"google-anno-t\">recruitment</span>&nbsp;was released for&nbsp;<strong>208 posts</strong>. Applications for the <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"829\">UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory</strong></span><strong> <span class=\"google-anno-t\">Recruitment</span>&nbsp;2026</strong>&nbsp;were accepted from&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1003\">2<span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">7 July 2026, to&nbsp;24 August 2026</span></strong>. Candidates who had appeared in this Examination can download their <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><strong data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"974\">UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Eligibility Result 2026</strong></span>&nbsp;from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Eligibility Result 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt No:- 15 Exam 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>27 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>24 August 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>24 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>24 August 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Eligibility Result : <strong>27 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date&nbsp;:<b> Notify Soon</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available&nbsp;<b>: Before Exam</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC : <strong>Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, Candidates : <strong>Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH Candidates:<strong> Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool –</span> </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 208 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Scientific Assistant (Regular)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">134</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Scientific Assistant (Special Recruitment)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">13</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Lab Assistant (Regular)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">56</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Lab Assistant (Special Recruitment)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">05</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.719%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.281%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.719%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientific Assistant (Regular)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.281%;\" rowspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong>Postgraduate degree in the relevant discipline</strong> as follows: <strong>Life Science, Physical Science, or Chemistry for the respective domain,</strong> or a Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science for the Computer Science domain from a recognized university. Preference will be given to <strong>candidates possessing a Ph.D. in the relevant subject,</strong> a Postgraduate qualification in Computer Science (for the Computer Science domain), at least <strong>2 years of relevant work experience,</strong> or a valid ‘B’ Certificate of the National Cadet Corps (NCC).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.719%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Scientific Assistant (Special Recruitment)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.719%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Lab Assistant (Regular)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.281%;\" rowspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong>Postgraduate degree in the relevant discipline,</strong> including <strong>Life Science, Physical Science, or Chemistry, or a Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or an ‘A’ Level certificate</strong> from DOEACC/NIELIT from a recognized university or institution. Preference will be given to candidates with at least <strong>2 years of relevant work experience</strong> or a valid NCC ‘B’ Certificate.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.719%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Lab Assistant (Special Recruitment)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Eligibility Result 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Open the&nbsp;<strong>Download Eligibility Result</strong>&nbsp;link from the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links&nbsp;</strong>box placed below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to fill up the required fields given as following:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration ID/ Roll Number/ Name</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Father’s Name (In case of searching by name)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">And Click on&nbsp;<strong>Search</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After submitting the correct details, applicants will be able to download the eligibility result.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Forensic Science Laboratory Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Shortlisting (PET 2025 Score)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center